  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Place peeled &amp; chopped pumpkin on a lined <br>oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with <br>garlic &amp; herb seasoning and season with salt.<br>• Toss to coat, then spread out evenly. Roast until <br>tender, 20-25 minutes. <br>TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the pumpkin <br>between two trays. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819748ed15aa7b407b75036/step-9d752e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.<br>• Drain and rinse chickpeas. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819748ed15aa7b407b75036/step-b4d67c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine baby spinach <br>leaves, shredded cabbage mix and half the <br>plant-based aioli.<br>• Drizzle with olive oil, then season with salt and <br>pepper. Toss to combine. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819748ed15aa7b407b75036/step-5b7a3c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the pumpkin has 10 minutes remaining, <br>heat a medium saucepan over medium-high <br>heat with a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook garlic, paprika spice blend and tomato <br>paste, stirring until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819748ed15aa7b407b75036/step-2d807e30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add chickpeas, the water, plant-based butter<br>and brown sugar to the paprika mixture.<br>• Cook, stirring, until slightly thickened, <br>3-4 minutes.<br>• Remove pan from heat, then add the honey. <br>Season with pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819748ed15aa7b407b75036/step-1b78fc40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Roughly chop roasted almonds.<br>• Divide paprika chickpeas, pumpkin and spinach <br>slaw between bowls. <br>• Sprinkle with almonds and top with a dollop of <br>remaining plant-based aioli to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819748ed15aa7b407b75036/step-161d9e50.jpg"
    }
  ]
